0. The latest Demo update is complete! Compared to the previous version and a lot of changes, I hope you can have fun!
1. I have been busy with development recently, so I forgot the time. I can't finish the new trial version on August 4th, so I can only update the new trial version on August 11th;
2. Because it will be released soon, I have been doing game testing recently to see if I can find some bugs; But no bugs have been found so far; The more you don't find a BUG, you always feel like there will be a BUG; It's a wonderful feeling;
3. Recently, I have been thinking about one thing, because the game is approaching the release date, and whether the current game meets a minimum level of fun to play;
4. However, there is no good way to collect feedback from players; Therefore, at present, I can only wait for the game to be released, and see what kind of feedback players have in the development adjustment; I don't know if this is the right thing to do;
5. Recently I often search some other STG games, it seems that there are very few bullets that can eliminate each other at present;
6. Therefore, I hope that this type of STG I developed can bring you a completely different game experience.

●BUG:
○ Fixed a BUG that sometimes appeared when launching the game while the Steam client was still running.

● Difficulty related:
○ In order to be more suitable for beginners, the overall difficulty has dropped a lot, which is specific for the initial 80% of the "bullet monster", are changed to "white bullet-free monster";
○ Adjusted the order of the wave number of some bosses;
○ Added many bosses to Wave 85;

●UI related:
○ Optimized the original bullet acquisition, bullet display UI is not intuitive problem;
○ Added "Heart, sword, shield, star" icon UI, used to display the player's "health, attack, defense, magic" attributes;

●85 wave count:
○ The first time you kill the Forest Fairy Dragon, the wave number is expanded from 55 to 65 waves;
○ The second time you kill the Forest Fairy Dragon, the wave count is extended from a further 65 waves to 85 waves;
○ Forest Fairy Dragon's health is increased by 100% because the key can obtain various bullet stocks and attributes;

● New items:

○ New bullets:
■B bomb:
● A player bullet that fires a barrage;

○ Gemstones of various colors:
■ Green: Experience bonus item;
■ Red: An item with increased health;
■ Orange: An item with increased attack power;
■ Blue: Increased defense item;
■ Purple: Increased mana item;

○ Various colors of blood bottles:
■ Yellow: Restored 20% of attributes;
■ Blue: 40% of attributes restored;
■ Red: 60% of attributes restored;

○ Various colors of keys:
■ Yellow, blue, red sort;
■ The probability of obtaining high treasures is: yellow < blue < red;

○ New Elite enemies:
■ Elite enemies will drop keys, through which they can open various items, currently gems, blood bottles, gems;

Demo: (0.12) (2024-0505)
● New "Rewards Bar" :
○ Completion of the reward bar system, to obtain "reward items", will be listed in the "reward bar", players choose a item to obtain;

● New "Reward Enemies" :
○ Will appear in a fixed wave number, providing "bonus items" dropped enemies;

● New "Forest Fairy Dragon" :
○10-40 wave BOSS appears, as long as 10 seconds do not kill, there will be a "forest fairy dragon", with high health, as long as kill, will push the maximum number of waves in the game 10 waves, so that you can challenge 46-55 wave levels;

● Video:
○ Added, when playing the video, press the Up key to switch the players watching the game;
■ Generally this is valid for multiplayer game recording in online mode;

For the next demo, what may be updated:
1. New branch processes and scenarios;
2. Undecided, there may be a new system; (Not yet decided whether to put into use)

Demo: (0.10) (2024-0407)
● Memory leak BUG:
