● Online:
○ Completion of the initial phase;
○ There should be many problems at present, and further tests are needed;
○ Can initially be connected through Steam;
● Video:
○ Video can be played through the direction keys to control acceleration and deceleration;
○ During video playback, you can inherit the current progress of the video by pressing F1 at any time, and switch to manual operation for game processing;

For the next demo, what may be updated:
1. Continue to research and develop the game progress;
2. Continue to improve the online module;

